#: includes/settings.php
msgid "How often gather data"
msgstr "Ni kangahe hakusanywa amakuru"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If enabled, Evidence will gather data periodically. If disabled, you can only view data for specific host"
msgstr "Niba byafunguwe, Evidence izakusanya amakuru rimwe na rimwe. Niba byahagaritswe, ushobora kureba gusa amakuru ya Mwakirizi wihariye"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Byahagaritswe"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Every %d hours"
msgstr "Buri masaha %d"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Every day"
msgstr "Buri munsi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Every week"
msgstr "Buri cyumweru"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When evidence will be started"
msgstr "Igihe ibimenyetso bizatangirira"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "The Base Time for gather data to occur.  For example, if you use '12:00am' and you choose once per day, the action would begin at approximately midnight every day."
msgstr "Igihe fatizo cyo gukusanya amakuru.  Urugero, niba ukoresheje '12:00am' kandi ugahitamo rimwe ku munsi, igikorwa kizatangira hafi ya saa sita z'ijoro buri munsi."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "How many changes store in database"
msgstr "Umubare w'impinduka zibikwa mu bubiko bw'amakuru"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If data gathering is enabled,  you can specify how many history (changed) records keep for each device"
msgstr "Niba ikusanyamakuru ryafunguwe, ushobora kugaragaza umubare w'inyandiko z'amateka (zahindutse) zibikwa kuri buri Gikoresho"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Without history"
msgstr "Nta mateka"

