#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Display information on device edit page"
msgstr "Erekana amakuru ku rupapuro rwo guhindura Igikoresho"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If enabled, flowview will display evidence data on device edit page"
msgstr "Niba byafunguwe, flowview izerekana amakuru ya evidence ku rupapuro rwo guhindura Igikoresho"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Send email on evidence information change"
msgstr "Ohereza imeyili igihe amakuru y'ibimenyetso ahindutse"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If evidence find change, send email"
msgstr "Niba evidence ibonye impinduka, ohereza Imeyili"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Excluded notification Host IDs"
msgstr "ID za Mwakirizi zitabona amenyesha"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Some devices report hw changes too often. You can exclude these host from email notification. Insert Host IDs, comma separator"
msgstr "Ibikoresho bimwe bitanga raporo y'impinduka za hardware kenshi cyane. Ushobora gukura aba bakirizi mu imenyekanisha rya imeyili. Shyiramo ID za Mwakirizi, zitandukanyijwe n'akitso"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Excluded notification device templates"
msgstr "Inyandikorugero z'ibikoresho zitabona amenyesha"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Some devices types report hw changes too often. You can exclude these templates from email notification. Insert device templates IDs, comma separator"
msgstr "Ubwoko bumwe bw'ibikoresho butanga raporo y'impinduka za hardware kenshi cyane. Ushobora gukura izi nyandikorugero mu imenyekanisha rya imeyili. Shyiramo ID z'inyandikorugero z'igikoresho, zitandukanyijwe n'akitso"

